@startuml sl-05-facility-staff
skinparam dpi 150
skinparam defaultFontName Arial
skinparam roundcorner 6
skinparam conditionStyle inside

title Flow 5 — Facility Unit Layout Management & Staff Shift Scheduling

|Facility Manager|
start
:Access Facility Manager Operations Portal;

fork
  :Manage Physical Storage Units & Facility Layout (FM-01);
  :Select facility floor and zone;
  :Add new physical storage units mapped to Master Unit Types;
  :Assign visual grid coordinates (row, column, floor level);
  if (Need maintenance or deep cleaning?) then (yes)
    :Update StorageUnit status: AVAILABLE -> MAINTENANCE / OUT_OF_SERVICE;
  else (operational)
    :Maintain unit in AVAILABLE status;
  endif
fork again
  :Organize Weekly Staff Roster & Daily Shift Dispatching (FM-05);
  :Select calendar week and facility staff members;
  :Assign morning/afternoon shifts and primary responsibilities (Check-in, Checkout, Inspection, Support);
  :Publish weekly schedule;
end fork

|System|
:Persist storage unit catalog and spatial floorplan layout in database;
:Create StaffDailyAssignment records for scheduled staff members;
:Publish shift notifications to staff members' daily desks;

|Facility Staff|
:Log into Facility Staff Portal at start of shift (FS-06);
:Review Assigned Daily Tasks (Pending Check-ins, Scheduled Returns, Support Tickets);
:Confirm on-duty attendance for scheduled facility shift;
:Execute physical operations (Check-in handover, exit inspection, unit cleaning, patrol);
:Mark completed tasks throughout the shift;

|System|
:Update task completion logs and audit history in realtime;

|Facility Manager|
:Monitor live staff attendance and daily task progress in FM dashboard;
stop
@enduml

